            "description": {
              "content": "Uploads a <<glossary:partner>> Image. Available image_keys, along with the supported file types and sizes are in the table below.\n<table border=1px cellpadding=5px>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<th>Image Key</th>\n\t\t<th>Supported File Types</th>\n\t\t<th>Image Dimensions</th>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td>profile</td>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpeg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.png</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td>192x192</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td>header</td>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpeg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.png</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td>640x200</td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>",
